{"text":"kuruntokai","n":384,"lines":["உழுந்துடைக் கழுந்திற் கரும்புடைப் பணைத்தோள்","நெடும்பல் கூந்தற் குறுந்தொடி மகளிர்","நலனுண்டு துறத்தி யாயின்","மிகநன் றம்ம மகிழ்நநின் சூளே"],"tr":["uḻuntuṭaik kaḻuntiṟ karumpuṭaip paṇaittōḷ","neṭumpal kūntaṟ kuṟuntoṭi makaḷir","nalaṉuṇṭu tuṟatti yāyiṉ","mikanaṉ ṟamma makiḻnaniṉ cūḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஓரம்போகியார்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Ōrampōkiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 7, āciriyattaḷai 6, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"உழுந்துடைக்","tr":"uḻuntuṭaik","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உழுந்","tr":"uḻun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துடைக்","tr":"tuṭaik"}]},{"text":"கழுந்திற்","tr":"kaḻuntiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழுந்","tr":"kaḻun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"திற்","tr":"tiṟ"}]},{"text":"கரும்புடைப்","tr":"karumpuṭaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரும்","tr":"karum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புடைப்","tr":"puṭaip"}]},{"text":"பணைத்தோள்","tr":"paṇaittōḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பணைத்","tr":"paṇait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோள்","tr":"tōḷ"}]}],[{"text":"நெடும்பல்","tr":"neṭumpal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடும்","tr":"neṭum"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பல்","tr":"pal"}]},{"text":"கூந்தற்","tr":"kūntaṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூந்","tr":"kūn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தற்","tr":"taṟ"}]},{"text":"குறுந்தொடி","tr":"kuṟuntoṭi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குறுந்","tr":"kuṟun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொடி","tr":"toṭi"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]}],[{"text":"நலனுண்டு","tr":"nalaṉuṇṭu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நல","tr":"nala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னுண்","tr":"ṉuṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டு","tr":"ṭu"}]},{"text":"துறத்தி","tr":"tuṟatti","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறத்","tr":"tuṟat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]},{"text":"யாயின்","tr":"yāyiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யின்","tr":"yiṉ"}]}],[{"text":"மிகநன்","tr":"mikanaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மிக","tr":"mika"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நன்","tr":"naṉ"}]},{"text":"றம்ம","tr":"ṟamma","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றம்","tr":"ṟam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ம","tr":"ma"}]},{"text":"மகிழ்நநின்","tr":"makiḻnaniṉ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மகிழ்","tr":"makiḻ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"நநின்","tr":"naniṉ"}]},{"text":"சூளே","tr":"cūḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சூ","tr":"cū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"உழுந்துடை","parts":[{"text":"உழுந்து","lemma":"uḻuntu","gloss":"black gram"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having black gram"},{"surface":"கழுந்தின்","parts":[{"text":"கழுந்து","lemma":"kaḻuntu","gloss":"stake/post"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"comparative suffix"}],"gloss":"like the post"},{"surface":"கரும்புடை","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பு","lemma":"karumpu","gloss":"sugarcane"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having sugarcane"},{"surface":"பணைத்தோள்","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"paṇai","gloss":"thick/bamboo-like"},{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulders"}],"gloss":"thick shoulders"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடும்பல்","parts":[{"text":"நெடும்பல்","lemma":"நெடும்பல்","gloss":"long and abundant"}],"gloss":"long and abundant","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கூந்தல்","parts":[{"text":"கூந்தல்","lemma":"kūntal","gloss":"hair"}],"gloss":"hair"},{"surface":"குறுந்தொடி","parts":[{"text":"குறுந்தொடி","lemma":"குறுந்தொடி","gloss":"small bangles"}],"gloss":"small bangles","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"makaḷir","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நலன்","parts":[{"text":"நலன்","lemma":"nalan","gloss":"beauty/goodness"}],"gloss":"beauty"},{"surface":"உண்டு","parts":[{"text":"உண்டு","lemma":"uṇ","gloss":"having consumed/enjoyed"}],"gloss":"having enjoyed"},{"surface":"துறத்தி","parts":[{"text":"துற","lemma":"tuṟa","gloss":"abandon"},{"text":"தி","lemma":"ti","gloss":"second person singular suffix"}],"gloss":"you abandon"},{"surface":"ஆயின்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயின்","lemma":"āyiṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மிக","parts":[{"text":"மிக","lemma":"mika","gloss":"very"}],"gloss":"very"},{"surface":"நன்று","parts":[{"text":"நன்று","lemma":"naṉṟu","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"amma","gloss":"indeed/alas (expletive)"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"மகிழ்ந","parts":[{"text":"மகிழ்","lemma":"makiḻ","gloss":"rejoice"},{"text":"ந","lemma":"na","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the agricultural tract!"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"niṉ","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"சூளே","parts":[{"text":"சூள்","lemma":"cūḷ","gloss":"oath/vow"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"oath"}]}],"literal":"Having black gram, like the post, having sugarcane, thick shoulders, / long and abundant hair, small bangles, women, / beauty having enjoyed, you abandon if, / very good indeed, O lord of the agricultural tract, your oath!","translation":"If you are going to abandon those women of small bangles and long, abundant hair, whose thick shoulders are like sugarcane stalks or the posts in black-gram fields, after having enjoyed their beauty, then your solemn oath of fidelity is indeed very good, O lord of the agricultural tract!","modern":"உளுந்துப் பயிர்கள் படர்ந்த கம்புகளைப் போலவும், கரும்புகளைப் போலவும் பருத்த தோள்களையும், நீண்ட அடர்ந்த கூந்தலையும், சிறிய வளையல்களையும் உடைய பரத்தையரின் அழகை நுகர்ந்துவிட்டு அவர்களை நீ பிரிந்துவிடுவாய் என்றால், வயல்நாட்டுத் தலைவனே! நீ இப்போது செய்யும் சத்தியம் மிகவும் அழகியதுதான்!","explanation":"The confidante (tōḻi) of the heroine speaks to the hero (makiḻṉaṉ) when he returns from his courtesans and tries to swear an oath of fidelity to appease the heroine. She mockingly addresses him, pointing out his habit of enjoying and then discarding women. She describes the courtesans as having beautiful, thick shoulders resembling sugarcane stalks or the stakes in black-gram fields, and long, abundant hair. With sharp sarcasm, she tells him that if he is simply going to abandon these women after consuming their youth and beauty, his solemn vows are indeed 'very good'—implying they are completely worthless. This poem belongs to the Marutam tiṇai (agricultural landscape), which deals with infidelity and lovers' quarrels, using agricultural imagery like sugarcane and black-gram fields to mirror the hero's behavior.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}